    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B takes the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Cómo es tu hermano pequeño?” (Put the verb in the right form.)",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer. The blue tile ser / estar is a choice: pick the verb that gives the meaning of the situation, and put it in the right form. Some adjectives change meaning: ser listo (clever) and estar listo (ready), ser aburrido (boring) and estar aburrido (bored). Events take ser for their place (La fiesta es en …), people and things take estar (… está en …).",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Last, swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
